Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:30:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 28/37] Eden (Doris): performance report (setting, off by
 default)

Every 10 seconds while a game runs: fps and frame-time percentiles, frames over 40 ms, CPU time
per emulator thread with the core it last ran on, CPU cluster clocks, GPU load and clock, and
battery temperature, written to the log (Share debug logs).
